Z||000000||firstfiero||01-29-2001||05:37 PM||||     I know this isn't much to complain about but my car didn't pass inspection. I need a new brake calibur and my parking brake cable is shot. $250 bucks...like credit card bills weren't enough this month.. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif">..oh well,it's still better then having a second car payment!!  I usually take my car to someone who isn't very picky with inspection. Tires,lights brake shoes...here's your sticker but I wanted to make sure everything was right with the fiero. Theyre charging me 105.00 for the calibur alone. according to the fiero store that really isn't that bad a price. sorry for venting....especially with the other problems I here it'll probobly seem kinda silly!  86se||||reg||8
Z||000001||Black88GT||01-29-2001||09:40 PM||||PA inspection is nothing compared to MD inspection.  PA is just safety stuff, i.e. brakes and tires.  MD inspection is like a bazillion things, formulated so a mechanic can rip off people as he choses.<P>------------------<BR>Jeff<BR>'88 GT t-top 3.4<BR>Baltimore, MD<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://cgi.tripod.com/smilecwm/cgi-bin/s/sp/cartmanico.gif">             <IMG SRC="http://cgi.tripod.com/smilecwm/cgi-bin/s/sp/kennyico.gif">           <IMG SRC="http://cgi.tripod.com/smilecwm/cgi-bin/s/sp/stanico.gif">         <IMG SRC="http://cgi.tripod.com/smilecwm/cgi-bin/s/sp/kyleico.gif">             <IMG SRC="http://cgi.tripod.com/smilecwm/cgi-bin/s/sp/chefico.gif"> ||||reg||1
