Z||000008||Raydar||01-30-2001||10:11 AM||||Be careful what you ask for. In GA, we <I>don't have</I> a safety inspection. <BR>As long as your car exhales clean air, they don't care if it sheds parts as it goes down the road. And the clean air thing is only if you live within commuting distance of Atlanta, and maybe Macon. You'd be amazed at some of the rolling $h!tpiles on our roads.  <P>------------------<BR>Raydar - aka Steve<P>88 T-top Formula<BR>88 soon-to-be-V6 coupe||||reg||1
